
@foundry =  http://127.0.0.1:5271

### List models (try common endpoints)
GET {{foundry}}/v1/models
Accept: application/json

### Chat completion (OpenAI-style endpoint)
POST {{foundry}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Phi-3-mini-128k-instruct-cuda-gpu:2",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "say hello"}],
  "max_tokens": 50
}